<title>USA: PepsiCo may announce restaurant spinoff - WSJ.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo may announce restaurant spinoff - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc could announce the spin-off of its $11 billion restaurant business as early as Thursday, the Wall Street Journal reported.</p>
<p>The paper said the company's board is scheduled to meet on Thursday. No one at the company could be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>There has been speculation that Pepsi would spin off its restaurant division, which includes Pizza Hut, Taco Bell and Kentucky Fried Chicken.</p>
<p>The report said it is unclear if international operations, which account for about 18 percent of restaurant sales, would be included in a spin-off.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
